<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine May inflation slows to 4.2 pct. [CORRECTED 02:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Philippine May inflation slows to 4.2 pct. [CORRECTED 02:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine annualised consumer inflation for May fell to 4.2 percent against 4.6 percent in April, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	    May 97   Apr 97  May 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	+0.0   +0.1    +0.3</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change		+4.2   +4.6   +10.4</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     236.0   236.1   226.5</p>
<p>(Corrects index figures from  228.8   229.2   220.9)</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (63 2) 810-9638 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
